WEBVTT

00:01.880 --> 00:03.400
The general guards Tianhe

00:03.640 --> 00:05.120
Is a pillar of the state

00:05.200 --> 00:06.000
Naturally deserves it

00:06.080 --> 00:07.480
This gift of mine

00:09.640 --> 00:10.200
This

00:10.280 --> 00:11.560
This is

00:11.640 --> 00:13.307
The style of northern Yanzhou

00:14.440 --> 00:16.440
It has to be Minister Xie

00:16.520 --> 00:17.640
Whatever material things he wants

00:17.720 --> 00:19.120
He can obtain

00:19.280 --> 00:21.680
But these old things brought from the north

00:21.760 --> 00:22.960
Once given away

00:23.040 --> 00:24.360
There's one less

00:24.440 --> 00:26.200
General Zu, don't think this object is small

00:26.320 --> 00:27.080
As the saying goes

00:27.160 --> 00:28.200
Internalized in the heart

00:28.320 --> 00:29.440
Externalized in the thumb ring

00:29.520 --> 00:30.400
Never forget the original heart

00:30.560 --> 00:31.960
To achieve the end

00:32.160 --> 00:33.440
This is not just an object

00:33.520 --> 00:34.480
It's more a remembrance

00:34.560 --> 00:35.960
Of the north

00:38.440 --> 00:39.280
I

00:39.360 --> 00:40.760
Mean exactly this

00:46.160 --> 00:47.560
This general understands

00:47.640 --> 00:49.200
Your Highness and Minister Xie

00:49.280 --> 00:50.840
Are both people who remember the past

00:50.920 --> 00:52.320
Haven't forgotten the north

00:52.760 --> 00:53.920
Then this gift

00:54.000 --> 00:55.400
I, Zu

00:55.760 --> 00:57.160
Will shamelessly accept

01:04.640 --> 01:06.080
The inner hall is about to begin the banquet

01:06.160 --> 01:06.920
Prince of Jin

01:07.000 --> 01:08.040
Prince of Ning

01:08.120 --> 01:08.440
Please

01:08.520 --> 01:09.920
Please

01:13.120 --> 01:14.520
You know quality

01:14.640 --> 01:16.040
I made it up

01:16.160 --> 01:16.560
You

01:16.640 --> 01:18.040
You made it up

01:18.400 --> 01:19.800
You're something else

